<span style=3D"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, V=
erdana, sans-serif;">
                                    The winning formula in early 2026 is st=
ructured context, tiered rigor, smaller teams with higher leverage, and rel=
entless measurement of downstream effects. The teams that adapt AI tools wi=
thout the underlying taste and discipline are discovering that AI just make=
s their existing problems bigger. Teams with strong engineering cultures, r=
obust CI/CD, clear architectural standards, and effective review processes =
see AI compound their advantages. This is widening the gap between elite an=
d average teams.
