                                    </span>
</a>
<br>
<br>
<span style=3D"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, V=
erdana, sans-serif;">
                                    AI should be treated as an amplifier of=
 human capacity rather than a replacement. AI can still act autonomously wi=
th specific tasks, but in a way that is an extension of human decision-maki=
ng and context. This allows humans to do dramatically more work, more susta=
inably, with less injury and fatigue. The AI industry's dream of having a f=
ully autonomous AI employee is seductive, but it will likely set us up for =
disappointment.
